></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Fortunata Seer</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Damage, Accuracy, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Ghost Widow has assigned a Fortunata Seer for you to command. Fortunata Seers can glimpse moments into the future. They use this ability to increase the Perception of their teammate. Your access to this Fortunata Seer is very limited. You can only summon her once every 15 minutes, and she will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Soul Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Fortunata Seer.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Fortunata Seer (Mental Training)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>25% Psionic resistance; 33% Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize resistance; 50% Defense versus Melee, Ranged, and AoE attacks; 100% defense versus Psionic attacks; 100% To Hit increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Fortunata Seer (Mind Link)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Perception increase; 73% Confuse resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>35'</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Fortunata Seer (Mind Probe)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>92.47 Psionic damage; 40% Recharge decrease for 6 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.528</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Psionic</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Mastermind><b><font color=red>Mastermind Soul Mastery</font></b><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_ConeDoT.tga><b><font color=red>Night Fall</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Debuff To Hit, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Night Fall unleashes a cone-shaped burst of particles from the Netherworld. All targets within the modest range of this power take Negative Energy damage and have reduced Accuracy. Damage: Moderate (DoT), Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>3.36 Negative Energy damage every .3 second for 3 seconds; 5% To Hit decrease for 10 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>16.38</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>20 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Negative Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SelfBuffResistancePhysical.tga><b><font color=red>Dark Embrace</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Recharge, Resistance</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You tap into the energy of the Netherworld to protect yourself from damage. This Dark Embrace shrouds you and grants resistance to Lethal, Smashing, Negative Energy, and Toxic damage. Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>20.62 Smashing resistance; 20.62 Lethal resistance; 11.25 Toxic resistance; 11.25 Negative Energy resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Toggle</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0.1625</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_ConeImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>Soul Tentacles</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You can create a cone-shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows the souls of the damned to slip into our reality. These Soul Tentacles will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while they drain their life. You must be at Level 44 and have Night Fall or Dark Embrace before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate (DoT), Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>4.12 Negative Energy damage; 3.05 Negative Energy damage every 1 second for 8 seconds; 100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 versus critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 versus players only.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>25 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Negative Energy, Smashing</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedHold.tga><b><font color=red>Soul Storm</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Hold, Damage</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Like Ghost Widow, you can summon the souls of your victims to do your bidding. Soul Storm enraptures a single target with Hold while the life-force is drained from its body. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Soul Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>3.36 Negative Energy damage every 1 second for 11 seconds; 100% chance for a 10-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus critters only; 100% chance for an 8-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus players only.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Negative Energy</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Soldier of Arachnos><b><font color=red>Soldier of Arachnos Soul Mastery</font></b><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedRangedHighDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Gloom</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Debuff To Hit</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Gloom slowly drains a target of life while reducing its Accuracy. Gloom is slower than Dark Blast, but deals more damage over time. Damage: High (DoT), Recharge: Moderate</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>6.11 Negative Energy damage every .5 second for 4 seconds; 5% To Hit decrease for 10 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.1</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Negative Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_ConeImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>Soul Tentacles</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You can create a cone-shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows the souls of the damned to slip into our reality. These Soul Tentacles will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while they drain their life. Damage: Moderate (DoT), Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>2.78 Negative Energy damage; 3.75 Negative Energy damage every 1 second for 8 seconds; 100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 versus critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 versus players only.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>25 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Negative Energy, Smashing</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEModerateDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Dark Obliteration</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Debuff To Hit</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You hurl a large blast of Negative Energy that violently explodes on impact, exposing the dark power of the Netherworld to all foes near the target. Dark Obliteration can reduce the Accuracy of all affected targets. You must be at Level 44 and have Gloom or Soul Tentacles before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>25.02 Negative Energy damage; 5% To Hit decrease for 10 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>18.98</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Negative Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Blood Widow</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Recharge, Damage, Accuracy</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Ghost Widow has assigned a beautiful but deadly Blood Widow assassin for you to command. Her weapons of choice include retractable wrist-mounted razors and darts, all tipped in deadly poison. Your access to this Blood Widow is very limited, and you can only summon her once every 15 minutes. She will leave after 4 minutes or when defeated, or when you leave a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Soul Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Blood Widow.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Mental Training)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>25% Psionic resistance; 33% Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize resistance; 50% defense versus Melee, Ranged, and AoE attacks; 100% defense versus Psionic attacks; 100% To Hit increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Poison Dart)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>4.51 Lethal damage; 75% chance for 4.51 Toxic damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; decrease Regeneration 100%.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>120%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>150'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Lunge)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>56.38 Lethal damage; 80% chance for 5.63 Toxic damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; 20% Run, Jump, Fly Speed decrease for 6 seconds; 10% Recharge decrease for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Swipe)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>39.46 Lethal damage; 80% chance for 5.63 Toxic damage every 1 second for 3 seconds; 20% Run, Jump, Fly Speed decrease for 4 seconds; 10% Recharge decrease for 2 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>4.42</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.33</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>1.5</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Strike)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>56.38 Lethal damage; 80% for 5.63 Toxic damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; 20% Run, Jump, Fly Speed decrease for 6 seconds; 10% Recharge decrease for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>5.668</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.33</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>3.2</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Slash)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>74.42 Lethal damage; 80% for 5.63 Toxic damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; 20% Run, Jump, Fly Speed decrease for 6 seconds; 10% Recharge decrease for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>7.332</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.43</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4.8</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Eviscerate)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>95.85 Lethal damage; 80% for 5.63 Toxic damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; 20% Run, Jump, Fly Speed decrease for 6 seconds; 10% Recharge decrease for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Blood Widow (Spin)</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>56.38 Lethal damage; 80% for 5.63 Toxic damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; 20% Run, Jump, Fly Speed decrease for 6 seconds; 10% Recharge decrease for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.07</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br></tab>"
"BlackScorpionPlaque" "<tab name=Info><b><font color=red>Black Scorpion - Mace Mastery</font></b><br><br>Black Scorpion will give you access to an Arachnos Mace, and teach you how to use it in battle.<br></tab><tab name=Brute><b><font color=red>Brute Mace Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedRangedHighDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Mace Blast</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Executioner's Mace is capable of firing a powerful bolt of kinetic energy. The blast is powerful enough that it may knock some foes back. Arachnos Bane Spider Troopers call this the Power Blast. The Arbiters who invented it scoff at this simple term. Damage: Heavy, Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>18.35 Smashing damage; 18.35 Energy damage; 30% chance for a Knockdown.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.58</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>Web Envelope</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Executioner's Mace can lob a modified web grenade. Upon impact, the web grenade expels a strong, sinuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets in a wide area. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is slowed. The web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for players only; 20% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 20% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEModerateDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Disruptor Blast</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Disruptor Blast fires a tremendous charge of kinetic energy from your Executioner's Mace. This charge is so powerful it will explode on impact, blasting all nearby foes. Some affected foes may be knocked back by the force of the blast. You must be at Level 44 and have Mace Blast or Web Envelope before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>18.98</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Arachnobot Blaster</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Accuracy, Damage, Knockback, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion has granted you an Arachnobot Blaster for you to command. Arachnobot Blasters were created by Arachnos Orb Weavers to take down particularly powerful super-powered threats. Your access to this Arachnobot is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes, and it will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Mace Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Arachnobot Blaster.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.03</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Energy Pulse)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>22.09 Energy damage every .5 second for 2 seconds; 20% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.7</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Energy Blast)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>88.39 Smashing damage; 60% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.58</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.53</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Sweep Area)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>21.78 Energy damage every .5 second for 2 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.7</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>50 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Claw)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>47.36 Lethal damage.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>5.46</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Web)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Endurance Discount, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for players only; 50% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 50% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Resistance)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>20% Smashing, Lethal resistance; 30% Psionic resistance; 50% Recharge increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Power Jumping)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>5% Jump Speed increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Stalker><b><font color=red><br>Stalker Mace Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedRangedHighDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Mace Blast</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Bane Mace is capable of firing a bolt of kinetic energy. The blast is powerful enough that it may knock back some foes. Arachnos Bane Spider Troopers call this the Power Blast. The Arbiters who invented it scoff at this simple term. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>16.68 Smashing damage; 16.68 Energy damage; additional 33.36 Energy damage if hidden; 20% chance for additional 33.36 Energy damage if target is Held or Sleeping; 20% chance for a Knockdown.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedRangedModDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Mace Beam</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Debuff To Hit, Interrupt, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>This power fires an extremely long-range, accurate beam of kinetic energy from the Bane Mace that deals tremendous damage and knocks the target back. This is a sniper attack, best fired from a distance because it can be interrupted. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>38.37 Smashing damage; 38.37 Energy damage; additional 76.74 Energy damage if hidden; 20% chance for additional 76.74 Energy damage if target is Held or Sleeping; 100% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>125%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>150'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>17.94</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>24</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedHold.tga><b><font color=red>Web Cocoon</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Hold, Slow</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Bane Mace can fire a more powerful version of the common web grenade. The sinewy fibers of this grenade are strong enough to completely Hold one target. Targets able to resist the Hold are still likely to have their attack and movement speed dramatically slowed. Web Cocoon can also bring down flying targets and prevent foes from jumping. You must be at Level 44 and have Mace Blast or Mace before selecting this power. Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 10-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus critters only; 100% chance for an 8-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus players only; 50% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 50% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Arachnobot Spiderlings</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Accuracy, Damage, Debuff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion has granted you access to a small squadron of Arachnobot Spiderlings. Three Spiderlings that are one level less than you will show up when summoned. Your access to these Arachnobots is very limited. You can only summon them once every 15 minutes, and they will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Mace Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Arachnobot Spiderlings.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.03</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Spiderling (Chain Gun)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Debuff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>12.62 Lethal damage every .3 second for 2 seconds; 10% defense decrease for 5 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>5.46</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.7</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>3.8</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Spiderling (Claw)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>38.34 Lethal damage.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>4.42</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Spiderling (Resistance)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>20% Smashing, Lethal resistance; 30% Psionic resistance; 50% Recharge increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Spiderling (Power Jumping)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>5% Jump Speed increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Corruptor><b><font color=red><br>Corruptor Mace Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>Web Envelope</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Executioner's Mace can lob a modified web grenade. Upon impact, the web grenade expels a strong, sinuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets in a wide area. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is slowed. The web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for players only; 20% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 20% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; 13.12 Toxic resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SelfBuffResistancePhysical.tga><b><font color=red>Scorpion Shield</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Recharge, Buff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion's technologies are impressive, indeed. This energy shield grants you Defense to Lethal, Smashing, and Energy attacks and improves your resistance to Toxic damage. Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>11.25 Defense versus Smashing attacks; 11.25 Defense versus Lethal attacks; 7.25 Defense versus Energy attacks; 13.12 Toxic resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Toggle</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0.1625</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedHold.tga><b><font color=red>Web Cocoon</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Hold, Slow</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Bane Mace can fire a more powerful version of the common web grenade. The sinewy fibers of this grenade are strong enough to completely Hold one target. Targets able to resist the Hold are still likely to have their attack and movement speed dramatically slowed. Web Cocoon can also bring down flying targets and prevent foes from jumping. You must be at Level 44 and have Web Envelope or Scorpion Shield before selecting this power. Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 10-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus critters only; 100% chance for an 8-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus players only; 50% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 50% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Arachnobot Disruptor</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Accuracy, Damage, Recovery, Immobilize, Hold</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion has granted you an Arachnobot Disruptor for you to command. Arachnobots were created by Arachnos Orb Weavers to take down particularly powerful super-powered threats. Your access to this Arachnobot is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes, and it will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Mace Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Arachnobot Disruptor.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.03</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Disruptor (Disruptor Bolt)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Recovery</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>59.53 Energy damage; drains 6 Endurance versus critters only; drains 1.5 Endurance versus players only; 100% chance to decrease 100% Endurance recovery for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Disruptor (Disruptor Blast)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Recovery</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>13.53 Energy damage; 9.02 Energy damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; drains 3.75 Endurance versus critters only; drains 1 Endurance versus players only; 100% chance to decrease 100% Endurance recovery for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Disruptor (Disruptor Tesla)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Recovery, Hold</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>6.76 Energy damage; 100% chance for an 8-second Hold of strength 4.62 versus critters only; 100% chance for a 6-second Hold of strength 4.62 versus players only; drains 6 Endurance versus critters only; drains 1.5 Endurance versus players only; 100% chance to decrease 100% Endurance recovery for 8 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.58</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Disruptor (Claw)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>56.38 Lethal damage.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>2.34</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Disruptor (Web Spitter)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Endurance Discount, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 12-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for critters only; 100% chance for an 8-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for critters only; 20% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 20% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>10'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Disruptor (Resistance)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>10% Smashing, Lethal resistance; 20% Energy resistance; 30% Psionic resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Disruptor (Power Jumping)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>5% Jump Speed increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>10</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Mastermind><b><font color=red><br>Mastermind Mace Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>Web Envelope</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Nullifier Mace can lob a modified web grenade. Upon impact, the web grenade expels a strong, sinuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets in a wide area. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is slowed. The web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for players only; 20% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 20% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SelfBuffResistancePhysical.tga><b><font color=red>Scorpion Shield</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Recharge, Buff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion's technologies are impressive, indeed. This energy shield grants you Defense to Lethal, Smashing, and Energy attacks and improves your damage resistance to Toxic damage. Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>11.25 Defense versus Smashing attacks; 11.25 Defense versus Lethal attacks; 7.25 Defense versus Energy attacks; 13.12 Toxic resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Toggle</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0.1625</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedRangedModDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Mace Beam Volley</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Fires a volley of multiple kinetic energy blasts from your Nullifier Mace. These blasts spread out in a wide cone and are powerful enough to knock down some foes. You must be at Level 44 and have Web Envelope or Scorpion Shield before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>15.29 Smashing damage; 15.29 Energy damage; 30% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>50'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>18.98</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>50'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>35 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedHold.tga><b><font color=red>Web Cocoon</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Hold, Slow</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Bane Mace can fire a more powerful version of the common web grenade. The sinewy fibers of this grenade are strong enough to completely Hold one target. Targets able to resist the Hold are still likely to have their attack and movement speed dramatically slowed. Web Cocoon can also bring down flying targets and prevent foes from jumping. You must be at Level 44 and have Web Envelope or Web Cocoon before selecting this power. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Mace Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 10-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus critters only; 100% chance for an 8-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus players only; 50% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 50% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Dominator><b><font color=red><br>Dominator Mace Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedDeBuffDefense.tga><b><font color=red>Poisonous Ray</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Endurance Discount, Range, Recharge, Debuff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Bane Mace can fire a nasty poison ray. This toxin is suspended in a polarized plasma field and delivered like an energy blast. Upon impact, the toxin directly attacks the immune system, reducing the affected targets' Defense and damage resistance as it deals Toxic damage. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>18.07 Energy damage; 1.8 Toxic damage every 1 second for 10 seconds; 15% To Hit decrease for 30 seconds; 15% resistance to all resistances for 30 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>24</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SelfBuffResistancePhysical.tga><b><font color=red>Scorpion Shield</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Recharge, Buff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion's technologies are impressive, indeed. This energy shield grants you Defense to Lethal, Smashing, and Energy attacks and improves your damage resistance to Toxic damage. Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>11.25 Defense versus Smashing attacks; 11.25 Defense versus Lethal attacks; 7.25 Defense versus Energy attacks; 13.12 Toxic resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Toggle</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0.1625</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEModerateDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Disruptor Blast</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>This power fires a tremendous charge of kinetic energy from your Bane Mace. This charge is so powerful it will explode on impact, blasting all nearby foes. Some affected foes may be knocked back by the force of the blast. You must be at Level 44 and have Poisonous Ray or Scorpion Shield before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>18.07 Smashing damage; 18.07 Energy damage; 20% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>18.98</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Toxic Tarantula</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Accuracy, Damage, Slow, Debuff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion has granted you a Toxic Tarantula for you to command. Weaver One developed the Tarantula Exoskeleton Armor, which so radically transforms an Arachnos troop that hardly anything human is recognizable. Your access to this Tarantula is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes, and it will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Mace Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Toxic Tarantula.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.03</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Toxic Tarantula (Venom Bolt)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>45.1 Energy damage; 1.48 Toxic damage every .7 second for 6 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.53</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Toxic Tarantula (Venom Burst)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Slow, Debuff Defense</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>13.53 Energy damage; 4.51 Toxic damage every .7 second for 6 seconds; 20% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 6 seconds; 10% Recharge decrease for 6 seconds; 10% Defense decrease for 6 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.7</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>10'</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Toxic Tarantula (Toxic Claw Pierce)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>33.83 Lethal damage; 6.76 Toxic damage every 1 second for 5 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Toxic Tarantula (Toxic Claw Shred)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>33.83 Lethal damage; 6.76 Toxic damage every 1 second for 5 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>10'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.7</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.83</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>10'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>45 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Toxic Tarantula (Web)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Endurance Discount, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for players only; 50% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 50% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>45 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Toxic Tarantula (Armored Exoskeleton)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>10% Smashing, Lethal resistance; 40% Toxic resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Soldier of Arachnos><b><font color=red>Soldier of Arachnos Mace Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedRangedHighDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Mace Blast</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Executioner's Mace is capable of firing a powerful bolt of kinetic energy. The blast is powerful enough that it may knock some foes back. Arachnos Bane Spider Troopers call this the Power Blast. The Arbiters who invented it scoff at this simple term. Damage: Heavy, Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>18.35 Smashing damage; 18.35 Energy damage; 30% chance for a Knockdown.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.58</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>Web Envelope</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Executioner's Mace can lob a modified web grenade. Upon impact, the web grenade expels a strong, sinuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets in a wide area. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is slowed. The web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for players only; 20% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 20% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedAoEModerateDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Disruptor Blast</font></b><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The Disruptor Blast fires a tremendous charge of kinetic energy from your Executioner's Mace. This charge is so powerful it will explode on impact, blasting all nearby foes. Some affected foes may be knocked back by the force of the blast. You must be at Level 44 and have Mace Blast or Web Envelope before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>105%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>18.98</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>15'</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Smashing, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Arachnobot Blaster</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Accuracy, Damage, Knockback, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Black Scorpion has granted you an Arachnobot Blaster for you to command. Arachnobot Blasters were created by Arachnos Orb Weavers to take down particularly powerful super-powered threats. Your access to this Arachnobot is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes, and it will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Mace Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Arachnobot Blaster.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.03</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Energy Pulse)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>22.09 Energy damage every .5 second for 2 seconds; 20% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.7</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Energy Blast)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>88.39 Smashing damage; 60% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.58</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.53</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Sweep Area)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>21.78 Energy damage every .5 second for 2 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.7</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>50 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Energy</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Claw)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>47.36 Lethal damage.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>5.46</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Web)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Endurance Discount, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for players only; 50% Run, Fly, and Jump Speed decrease for 15 seconds; 50% Recharge decrease for 15 seconds; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Resistance)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>20% Smashing, Lethal resistance; 30% Psionic resistance; 50% Recharge increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Arachnobot Blaster (Power Jumping)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>5% Jump Speed increase.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br></tab>"
"CaptainMakoPlaque" "<tab name=Info><b><font color=red>Captain Mako - Leviathan Mastery</font></b><br><br>Captain Mako will embolden you with the knowledge of the Coralax and their mysterious powers over the seas.<br></tab><tab name=Brute><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Brute Leviathan Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedRangedHighDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Spirit Shark</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You are empowered with the Spirit of the Mako Shark. You can project this spirit to attack and maul your opponent. The shark's spirit energy will manifest and attack your foe, quickly dealing heavy Lethal damage over time. Damage: Heavy (DoT), Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>27.805 Lethal damage; 2.78 Lethal damage every 1 second for 4 seconds; 100% chance for a Knockdown.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.58</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_ConeImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>School of Sharks</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You can call forth a school of vicious Shark Spirits that will swim out in a cone formation and will encircle your foes, draining their spirit energy. The encircling Shark Spirits will Immobilize most foes while they deal Negative Energy damage over time. Both you and the target must be near the ground for this power to activate. Damage: Moderate (DoT), Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>3.75 Negative Energy damage; 2.78 Negative Energy damage every 1 second for 8 seconds; 100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for players only.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>50'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.37</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>50'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>30 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_RangedConeModerateDmg.tga><b><font color=red>Bile Spray</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Sharks will eat anything, so their stomach acid must be powerful, indeed. You can regurgitate this acid and spew a corrosive spray of bile at a foe. Affected foes in the cone area will take Toxic damage over time. You must be at Level 44 and have Spirit Shark or School of Sharks before selecting this power. Damage: Moderate (DoT), Recharge: Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>19.46 Toxic damage; 2.78 Toxic damage every 1 second for 5 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>18.98</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>30 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Guardian Sentinel</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Accuracy, Damage, Knockback, Slow, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Captain Mako has shown you how to summon a Coralax Guardian Sentinel to do your bidding. These creatures are composed of living coral made from the sea-goddess Merulina. Your access to this Guardian is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes, and it will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Leviathan Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Guardian Sentinel.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Guardian Sentinel (Resistance)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>20% Smashing, Lethal resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Guardian Sentinel (Heavy Coral Hammer)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>74.42 Smashing damage; 30% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>8.58</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Smashing</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Guardian Sentinel (Heavy Stunning Blow)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Disorient</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>92.47 Smashing damage; 15% chance for an 8-second Disorient of strength 3.08 versus critters only; 15% chance for a 6-second Disorient of strength 3.08 versus players only.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.17</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Smashing</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Guardian Sentinel (Coral Dart)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>52.31 Lethal damage.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>7.54</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.07</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Guardian Sentinel (Coral Spray)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>41.04 Lethal damage.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.7</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>30 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Guardian Sentinel (Water Spray)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>45.1 Cold damage; 30% Run, Jump, and Fly Speed decrease for 10 seconds; 30% Recharge decrease for 10 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>40'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>30 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Cold</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Guardian Sentinel (Stone Prison)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Range, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>9.02 Smashing damage every 2 seconds for 10 seconds; 100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 4.62 for players only; disable Fly; 20% defense decrease for 15 seconds.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>9.75</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.93</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Smashing</td></tr></table><br></tab><tab name=Corruptor><b><font color=red><br>Corruptor Leviathan Mastery</b></font><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_ConeImmobilize.tga><b><font color=red>School of Sharks</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Immobilize, Range</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You can call forth a school of vicious Shark Spirits that will swim out in a cone formation and will encircle your foes, draining their spirit energy. The encircling Shark Spirits will Immobilize most foes while they deal Negative Energy damage over time. Both you and the target must be near the ground for this power to activate. Damage: Moderate (DoT), Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>5.62 Negative Energy damage; 4.17 Negative Energy damage every 1 second for 8 seconds; Scourge - additional 41.7 Negative Energy damage versus critters only; Scourge - additional 41.7 unresistible Negative Energy damage versus players only; 100% chance for a 15-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for critters only; 100% chance for a 10-second Immobilize of strength 3.57 for critters only.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>50'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>12.74</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>2.37</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>RADIUS:</td><td>50'</td></tr><tr><td>ARC:</td><td>30 degrees</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>AoE, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SelfBuffResistancePhysical.tga><b><font color=red>Shark Skin</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Recharge, Resistance</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>The power the Leviathan Mako has shown you seems to have no end. Shark Skin improves your damage resistance to Lethal, Smashing, and Cold damage. Recharge: Fast</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>20.62 Smashing resistance; 20.62 Lethal resistance; 20.62 Cold resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Toggle</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0.1625</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0.67</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_TargetedHold.tga><b><font color=red>Spirit Shark Jaws</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Recharge, Endurance Discount, Range, Hold, Damage</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>You can summon a massive Spirit Shark that will attack your foe from below. The shark will grip your foe with its massive jaws and attempt to Hold the target while it mauls it, dealing Lethal damage over time. Flying targets will likely be pulled to the ground. You must be at Level 44 and have School of Spirit Shark or Shark Skin before selecting this power. Recharge: Slow</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>5.62 Lethal damage; 4.17 Lethal damage every 1 second for 8 seconds; Scourge - additional 41.7 Lethal damage versus critters only; Scourge— additional 41.7 unresistible Lethal damage versus players only; 100% chance for a 10-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus critters only; 100% chance for an 8-second Hold of strength 3.57 versus players only; disable Fly.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>80'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.87</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>32</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Ranged, Lethal</td></tr></table><br><br><br><img src=Arachnos_Patron_SummonOnePet.tga><b><font color=red>Summon Red Coralax</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Endurance Discount, Range, Accuracy, Damage, Knockback, Slow, Disorient, Immobilize</td></tr><tr><td>POWER HELP TEXT:</td><td>Captain Mako has shown you how to summon a Coralax Red Hybrid to do your bidding. The Coralax are humans who have been infected with living coral. Your access to this Hybrid is very limited. You can only summon it once every 15 minutes, and it will leave after 4 minutes or if you exit a zone or mission. You must be at Level 47 and have two other Leviathan Mastery powers before selecting this power. Recharge: Extremely Long</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>Summon Red Coralax.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>60'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>3.2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>900</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Red Coralax (Resistance)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>20% Cold, Psionic resistance.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Auto</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Red Coralax (Punch)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>56.38 Smashing damage; 10% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>6.5</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.2</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Smashing</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>Red Coralax (Haymaker)</b></font><br><table><tr><td>BOOSTS ALLOWED:</td><td>Accuracy, Damage, Endurance Discount, Knockback</td></tr><tr><td>EFFECTS:</td><td>92.47 Smashing damage; 30% chance for a Knockback.</td></tr><tr><td>TYPE:</td><td>Click</td></tr><tr><td>ACCURACY:</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>RANGE:</td><td>5'</td></tr><tr><td>END COST:</td><td>10.66</td></tr><tr><td>INTERRUPT TIME:</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>CAST TIME:</td><td>1.5</td></tr><tr><td>RECHARGE TIME:</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><td>MAX TARGETS HIT:</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>ATTACK TYPES:</td><td>Melee, Smashing</td></tr></table><br><br><br><b><font color=red>