// TOURISM
// Overlord
"Grandville1" "You've visited the beach outside the Grandville city walls, where Lord Recluse viciously repelled an invasion of Longbow landing craft."
// A New Low
"Grandville2" "A new low, even for a villain, you've stumbled through the very bottom of Grandville into the area known as 'The Gutter'."
// Guttersnipe
"Grandville3" "Life at the bottom is rough, and after visiting Hobo Row in Grandville's Gutter you can agree."
// Master of the Airwaves
"Grandville4" "Top of the world!  You have climbed to the top of the radio tower in Grandville."